job-nation-lab-architect/              # Job Nation Lab/Architect

**Tagline:** Design, Tune, and Perfect AI-Powered Workflows

**Job Nation Lab/Architect** is a web-based hub where users can register, design, and tune AI-powered systems and workflows. Build modular blueprints, license outputs, and operate in a unified digital office that transforms ideas into real infrastructure.

## Overview
Job Nation enables users to:
- Register and access a personal workspace (The Lobby)
- Design AI-powered workflows and systems (The Office)
- Tune AI agents to perfection (The Lab)
- License, govern, and monitor outputs (The Bureau)
- Scale ideas into operational jobs and services

## Features
- AI system and workflow generation
- Modular job blueprint creation
- AI tuning tools and dashboards
- Licensing and monetization controls
- Unified operations and governance interface

